  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Minor climate interventions, Bangladesh 2009</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project includes support strengthening community capacity two address climate change. These activities are implemented by Action Aid. In addition, support is given two IUCN to strengthen Bangladesh&apos;s international f&#xf6;rhandlingarna and raising awareness for climate adaptation. Finally, supported the IWM technical analysis of climate and water resource conditions in the north-western part of Bangladesh.</narrative>
  </description>
